<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C APRIL NET TO PLN 2.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C APRIL NET TO PLN 2.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.94 vs   1.53</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.95 vs   2.91</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.94 vs   2.79</p>
<p> Sales		   29.69 vs  24.34</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.53 vs   3.05</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.17 vs   5.65</p>
<p> Operating profit    13.77 vs   6.63</p>
<p> Sales		  103.23 vs  83.47</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Cieszyn</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
